## Rate Limiting

### Strategy
- Per-connection rate limits (requests per minute)
- Tracked in memory (Redis if available, otherwise cache)
- Automatic connection rotation when limit reached

### Implementation
```php
// Check rate limit before executing
if ($this->isRateLimited($connection)) {
    // Rotate to next available connection
    $connection = $this->rotateConnection();
}

// Execute AI call
$response = $this->executeOnConnection($connection, $prompt, $options);

// Increment rate limit counter
$this->incrementRateLimit($connection);
```

